# 04 - SSH failures over time
# Purpose: Show the hourly shape of failed SSH logins.
# Sourcetype: secure (auth log lines)
# Look for: A sharp spike, a steady flat line, or a burst that starts suddenly.
# Time range: All time (the tutorial dataset is old, so recent ranges return nothing)
# Index: tutorial

index=tutorial sourcetype=secure "Failed password" | timechart span=1h count
